      "title": "Is Canada about to join the EU?",
      "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6wyz8kk2nepo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
      "description": "Ties between Canada and the European Union have been getting closer as trade dispute with the US continue.",
      "source_name": "BBC World News",
